WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:02.310
We have a voicemail number.

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:05.280
That number is 2 1 9 2, David P..

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:11.120
And in this voicemail, there's a question
asked about is someone coming up to you without

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.120
a mask?

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.139
An attack, in a sense.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:17.929
And if you are in a stand your ground state,
could you shoot such a person?

00:00:17.929 --> 00:00:19.170
Take a listen to this.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.170
Yes.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:23.509
Hi, this is Anton in Hawaii.

00:00:23.509 --> 00:00:27.789
Really curious about those states that have
stand your ground laws.

00:00:27.789 --> 00:00:33.170
So if you are outside and somebody and you're
in a mask and somebody comes up to you that's

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:34.750
not wearing a mask.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.210
Why not your shooter?

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:37.760
That's just my question.

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:38.760
My thought today.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:39.760
Thank you.

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:40.760
Yeah.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:41.760
Listen, I understand the idea.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.840
The idea is we've got a contagious disease.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:49.680
It's spreading virally because it is a virus
and people should be protecting it themselves

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.250
and each other by wearing masks.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:54.359
If someone comes up with you up to you with
no mask.

00:00:54.359 --> 00:00:59.720
If they cough on you, that potentially puts
your life in danger in the same way than if

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.750
they came up holding a gun and pointing it
at you.

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.340
I get the idea.

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:07.920
I don't believe that even in states with Stand
Your Ground, you would get away with shooting

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:10.970
someone who is coming up to you without a
mask.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.360
I don't recommend you do it.

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:15.780
If you really have questions about it, consult
law enforcement and a lawyer.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:17.229
But it sounds like a very, very bad idea.

00:01:17.229 --> 00:01:18.560
I understand the sentiment.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:23.780
I understand the idea, but it is not something
that I would imagine anyone is going to get

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:24.840
away with.

